---

<section class="plants" id="plants">
  <div class="plants__container">
    <div class="plants__content">
      <h2 class="plants__title" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1500">
        讓日常每一步<br />
        成為改變的力量
      </h2>
      <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1500" data-aos-delay="200">
        聯合線上實踐聯合國永續發展目標SDGs第17項「建立多元夥伴關係」，攜手高雄市愛種樹協會與健康促進平台Walkii，積極推動環境保護與職場健康，鼓勵上班族培養運動習慣，同時為地球盡一份心力。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="plants__img">
      <img
        src="./imgs/flowchart.png"
        alt="Plants Image"
        data-aos="zoom-in"
        data-aos-duration="1500"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @import '../style/_variable.scss';
  .plants {
    &__container {
      background-color: $BGColor;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-end;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1765px;
      @media screen and (max-width: 1280px) {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
    &__content {
      background-color: $mainColor;
      border-top-left-radius: 100px;
      height: 820px;
      flex: 0 1 666px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: justify;
      padding: 60px 83px;
      @media screen and (max-width: 1440px) {
        padding: 60px 33px;
        flex: 0 1 466px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 1280px) {
        padding: 120px 263px 180px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 1110px) {
        padding: 120px 203px 180px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 880px) {
        padding: 120px 63px 180px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 640px) {
        padding: 120px 63px 220px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        padding: 50px 43px 220px;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 25px;
        color: $whiteColor;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        @media screen and (max-width: 1110px) {
          font-size: 20px;
        }
      }
      p {
        font-size: 20px;
        color: $fontColor;
        line-height: 2;
        @media screen and (max-width: 1110px) {
          font-size: 18px;
        }
      }
    }
    &__img {
      width: 100%;
      border-top-left-radius: 100px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: $plantColor;

      @media screen and (max-width: 1280px) {
        margin-top: -10%;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 992px) {
        height: 1024px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 880px) {
        margin-top: -15%;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 640px) {
        margin-top: -30%;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        margin-top: -40%;
        // min-height: 650px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 390px) {
        margin-top: -52%;
        height: 873px;
      }
      img {
        border-top-left-radius: 100px;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: contain;
        display: block;

        @media screen and (max-width: 992px) {
          object-fit: cover;
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>
